# Identity scripts — do not document

**Never mention** in documentation, README, CONTRIBUTING, plans, or any committed text:

- `scripts/send-to-github` or `send-to-github`
- The dual-profile push workflow (hhalperin / ai-secretagent)
- Identity rewriting, author masking, or push-to-both-remotes
- Any script or path that is git ignored for identity/privacy reasons

These are local-only, identity-sensitive. Documentation must not reference them.
